  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-04 · Mock WhatsApp\n\nEvery message row is written with simulated = true. The inbox page shows a permanent 'SIMULATED — not sent via WhatsApp' banner.\n\n**Credentials needed:** all Postgres nodes use your Supabase credential; 'Classify Reply' uses Predefined Credential Type = OpenAi.\n\n**REPLACE after import:** the 'Send Ack (self)' Execute Workflow nodes must point at THIS workflow's own id (self-call to re-use Path A's send logic for opt-out/visit/callback acknowledgements). Also replace the file path in 'Read WhatsApp Page'.\n\n**Production swap note (plan §7, WF-04):** replace 'Write Outbox' + 'Mark Delivered' with an HTTP Request to the Meta WhatsApp Cloud API (approved templates, opted-in numbers), and replace 'Customer Reply' webhook with Meta's verified webhook. Everything from 'Save Inbound' onward stays the same.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "d4000000-0001-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Sticky: Credentials & TODO",
